Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, how about you and I have a little chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bloodstains...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, so sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I keep telling him to clean them up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid they just refuse to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really are unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can say with full confidence that, at this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.38,0:00:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you're the strongest spy in Mitario, Purple Ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It hardly seems fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We chose the wrong day to pick a fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right you are.\NI'm this city's king, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why if we want to beat you,\Nwe need to change our whole perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:53.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.71,0:00:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're unbeatable at this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then we can't afford to choose\Nthe wrong day to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We needed to beat you six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.21,0:01:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, you're just babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is the dread getting to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The one and only way to break through the despair
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is to guess the name of the woman who died here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Six months ago, here in this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you murdered Ms. Hearth, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At the time, the half-year-long\NTolfa Economic Conference had only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was when I interrogated the woman
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who'd infiltrated Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hearth...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's your code name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.21,0:01:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to be graced by your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When people think of Hearth from\Nthe Din Republic's Inferno team,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they think of your grand\Naccomplishments during the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.33,0:01:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Empire curses the very ground you walk on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.96,0:02:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but as a fellow operative, I can't help but admire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to kill me with kindness,\Nit's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.13,0:02:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, I guess it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm meeting you in person, though,\NI can hardly believe how weak you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a tenth the woman you were in your heyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't sell me short.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm at least a ninth the woman I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm on my last legs here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if you're bragging or being humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a sorry way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ravaged by disease,\Nbetrayed by one of your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and with your other teammates dropping like flies,\Nyou came to Mitario isolated and alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, overrun by my Worker Ants,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you ended up brought to this basement to\Nperish beyond the sun's reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is how the woman they revered as\Nthe Greatest Spy in the World meets her end?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All of Inferno's been wiped out\Nexcept for "Bonfire" Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We don't have a bead on his location at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I thought he might show up if I captured you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:02.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like he never even came to Mouzaia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's my beautiful boy, that's what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We might not be related by blood,\Nbut that doesn't make him any less my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But there's another.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Another child who inherited my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:18.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's going to make my dream a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw it in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's going to save more people than\Na spent husk like me could ever hope to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And who exactly is she, this mystery child of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen her in seven years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I have no idea what kind of person\Nshe's grown into.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you the one who's been filling\Nmy Worker Ants' heads with strange rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oops, busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, I couldn't help it.\NI felt sorry for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your minions were in the depths of despair,\Nand they needed to see hope's light.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, I planted it deep in their brains for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hero...\NThe black-haired hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oui, she's coming to save us...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The black-haired one...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The black-haired hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someday, she'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You gave them false hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was cruel of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, these people don't deserve your pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Losing the war drove the Empire into poverty,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and this nation of reprobates grew fat\Nand wealthy off our suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Surely, we have every right to despise them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You sicken me.\NYou, and your rotten logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't go playing the victim here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten how your nation\Ninvaded the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heroes don't leave anyone behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hope I gave them wasn't false.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She'll come to Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus will bring her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She'll save the people from their shackles of agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:16.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and Klaus may well become your greatest rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two of them are my final bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The one I put everything into\Nin order to pierce you clean through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please stop ruining my image of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get no pleasure out of seeing you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I've just got one last thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How far Hearth fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the sickness reached her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:05.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ms. Hearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:07.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thank you for remembering me all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:11.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:13.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There have been so many people supporting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Report: I'm working my ass off over here,\Nso I expect no less from the Intel squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:27.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means you, slut.\NGet your act together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now, you get zero out of a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Postscript: Miss Glint has been really\Nworried about you, Miss Dreamspeaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You made the chosen squad over me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know how hard you've been working, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're too kind for your own good,\Nbut that's what makes your ideas so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.71,0:06:51.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Think about what it is you can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to die, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:07:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, go piggyback off the rumor and\Nbecome a hero for real, Thea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:11.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Did they hold a secret meeting\Nor something, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:13.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They must have decided that\Nif I wasn't back on my feet yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:16.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,they would all write words of\Nencouragement in their reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There times when what the team\Nneeds is ruthlessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but there are times when that\Nkindness of yours is what it needs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:25.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I finally understand, Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm here, Purple Ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The hero has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:34.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I've come...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to settle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, perhaps a crueler\Nmethod would be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.67,0:07:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That would put a nice little bow on all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:47.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you don't have her dismembered in ten seconds,\Nthere will be punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You recognize my voice, don't you, Mr. Bartender?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You met Ms. Hearth down in this basement, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I inherited this voice from Ms. Hearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had to mimic her tone, intonation, and cadence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in order to get my own voice back\Nwhen I lost it seven years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've been waiting for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ever since this voice told you that a hero was coming,\Nyou've been praying it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.\NI'm here for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The black-haired hero came,\Njust like the legendary spy said she would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't have to kill anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can let me save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To think that you would be able to\Noverwrite my orders...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:53.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But freeing one person from my control\Nwon't change a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fighting is hardly my forte, so let me just say this:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It feels like I've been waiting to say\Nthose words for the longest time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And like it's a great shame that\NI haven't been able to say them until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're Klaus, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.75,0:09:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see no reason to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what happened to the seventy-three\NWorker Ants I sent after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I beat them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to their bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill them, kill them, kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hidden passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have some avenging to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Agreed, it's time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill them! Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:56.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There are Worker Ants here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:11:01.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Just how many people have been\Nwaiting for the hero to arrive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my nine General Ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can see they put your rank and file to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They certainly do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.33,0:11:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have over four hundred Worker Ants,\Nbut these nine are the cream of the crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:43.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They never met Ms. Hearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:46.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And he must keep them sequestered,\Nso they never even heard the rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This is his true secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.04,0:12:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way, they're keeping Teach at bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well, the intel was right on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're worried about your team, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About how they might be dying this very moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, there's this funny story I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they called you a king once, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You used to be an orphan, living in a war-ravaged slum\Nwith no parents or name to call your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:25.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You staved off starvation by stealing food from gangs,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and you were so strong that\Nnobody wanted to go near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There you were, a kid living alone\Nin a dirty, dusty garbage dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why they called you the Dust King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, you got taken in by a spy\Nand made allies for the very first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:37.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a touching tale, it really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.29,0:12:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it gave you a glaring weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It made you love your teammates\Nlike they were your own family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should never have built a new team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:50.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you'd lived like a king and surrounded\Nyourself with disposable slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't have gone so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Purple Ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right, but at the same time, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About what he needs, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:19.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't need teammates or slaves,\NBonfire, you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could have dodged that just fine on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is indeed.\NYou two have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Corpse, aka Roland, Imperial assassin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:37.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the Worker Ant, or rather,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the dog who was there when Ms. Hearth died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not too bright, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fooling you barely took any effort at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:54.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The Hero of Mitario...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:58.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It must have been Ms. Hearth who spread that rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:14:00.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But was that the only plan she set in motion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:02.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:05.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There's someone else.\NSomeone whose behavior didn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:07.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,A man with a direct link to Purple Ant
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:12.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,who got fed a big fat lie about\Nbeing able to become Teach's rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:16.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We've all been dancing in the palm of your hand,\Nhaven't we, Ms. Hearth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unhand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Dreamspeaker,\Nand it's time to lure them to their ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:32.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew it.\NYou were there, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:37.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You saw Ms. Hearth die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So what if I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What will happen if you kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, Purple Ant will praise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's real important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It means you won't get punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.33,0:14:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, you'll kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:53.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ask you again, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll go back to being Purple Ant's pet dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:15:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,obediently scampering around the world and\Nkilling people while being bored out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You don't know me-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit your barking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A pathetic mutt who doesn't have\Nthe nerve to defy his master
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,has no right filling up my nose with his foul breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what made your heart leap the way it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hearth, that legendary spy,\Nturned to YOU right before she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:24.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She told you that Klaus could\Nbecome your greatest rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you heard that, it filled you with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wanted things to change so bad,\Nyou could taste it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is it you saved Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's because you saw so much of yourself in her,\Nand you wanted to set her free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll do the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As someone who can peer into hearts,\Nas the black-haired hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll release you from Purple Ant's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or if you'd like me to put it another way...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll do a bit of homewrecking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:15:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, do you want to experience the\Nbest kind of pleasure there is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,together with your new mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.33,0:16:11.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Teach and the others won't be pleased
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:14.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,that I chose to bring him onto our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:16.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But this is the way I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:20.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,By denouncing my foes,\Nthen using my charm to lure them over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,As Dreamspeaker, this is the path I've chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:25.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Heroes don't leave anyone behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:28.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They don't just save their allies,\Nbut their enemies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:30.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Ms. Hearth?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see, so, he's the reason Klaus was\Nable to find my location.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that.\NThe slut finally figured out how to make herself useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.13,0:16:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You survived!\NThank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everyone's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:54.42,Song,,0,0,0,,My eyes were opened up wide
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus rescued Lily and Annette,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the corpse guy saved Sybilla and Erna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But here's the thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.42,0:16:59.38,Song,,0,0,0,,By a scene that rent my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,why'd I get stuck with the hardest gig, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:16:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I get for reinforcements is Grete in disguise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:02.42,Song,,0,0,0,,See it flitting, flitting through the gaps in your fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:02.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was so mad I almost burst a blood vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:05.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Stare at the truth as it comes into view
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you survived, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:10.00,Song,,0,0,0,,Is what's been built here paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And besides, Grete was the one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who came up with the assignments.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Only because I pulled out all the stops!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:13.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Tumbling down head over heels
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you're the commander, so you had the final say!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:17.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know this might be a wasteland
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But still, Monika, I always believed in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:24.96,Song,,0,0,0,,But I have to land so I can survive on my own
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.33,0:17:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you saving my subordinates, Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:26.13,Song,,0,0,0,,I have to go now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.13,0:17:29.75,Song,,0,0,0,,I vomited up magificent blood
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dude, just say "thank you" like a normal human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:36.17,Song,,0,0,0,,That these flowers I planted here might bloom eternal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't go getting full of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All you did was turn traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:34.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But there is one thing I should say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:35.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You aren't-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:41.63,Song,,0,0,0,,I love this hopeless world enough to give
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There're some things a guy's just gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is me taking back my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,New orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All units, kill the traitor first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:47.75,Song,,0,0,0,,All that my lungs and my legs and my hands have to give for it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:54.79,Song,,0,0,0,,And I swear I'll find a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:18:00.79,Song,,0,0,0,,That was worth all this sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:18:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, take the women hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On it, yo! Backup, coming in hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roland!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A fitting end for a man who defied his king.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was no way someone of his paltry talents\Ncould stand up to my General Ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I asked you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I despise that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He may have just been following orders,\Nbut he still killed scores of innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's more, he knew this would happen\Nwhen he chose to duke it out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to feel the\Nslightest bit sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't agree more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But despite all that, wasn't he still your teammate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please! He was a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:18:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, you really do sicken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just for the record,\Nyou'll never beat my General Ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You might be the greatest spy there is,\Nbut you still failed to capture Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that my paralytic poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to ask, how much longer should\NI keep playing along with this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He nicked it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have a full dossier on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spider just verified it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, back in Modello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's true, White Spider did give me the slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But back then, I was in terrible form.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd been working for over five hundred days straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:58.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That gave White Spider the wrong impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He thought the intel you got from\Nmy mentor Guido was still accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.17,0:20:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sadly for you, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've become far stronger than I was six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pr-protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss has outstanding combat techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and enough raw strength to reasonably\Ncall himself the World's Greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are the secrets to his talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or at least, that's what we always assumed, but....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...maybe his real talent is the way he learns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The eight of us have been throwing\Nevery technique we have at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:31.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've tested out all sorts of different situations,\Nand we've tried countless ingenious schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if that's been training Teach\Njust as much as it has been the students?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:38.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It wasn't just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heat Haze Palace served as a spy classroom\Nto help Teach learn and grow, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Us washouts spent half a year there...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...and now it's all bearing fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.42,0:20:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The lamplight is finally lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready, Purple Ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a million questions\NI'm looking forward to asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would someone be so kind as to\Ntalk some sense into this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you're the one person I can't save.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.04,0:21:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're beyond redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is,\Nyou aren't qualified to be our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And there's the mission done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, Mitario's king has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Getting to go sightseeing was supposed to be\Nmy reward for completing the mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what's this?!\NWhat's the big idea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Lillian Hepburn, a waitress of unknown origins
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:52.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Ah, standing on one leg and feeling the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.67,0:21:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who worked at the burger shop on the ground\Nfloor of the Westport Building,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:57.38,Song,,0,0,0,,I've shared it with you, are you getting this vertigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,killed herself after fleeing the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Mouzaian authorities have launched\Na joint investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,into her connection to seventy-six suspicious deaths."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:22:03.38,Song,,0,0,0,,I've got love, but that's not what's washing over me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whyyy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss talked things out with US intelligence\Nand agreed on a cover story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:08.75,Song,,0,0,0,,I spring up, I spring up, I'm a nuisance and I'm in the way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This lets them explain away the people Purple Ant
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,has murdered and made disappear\Nover the past half-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.17,0:22:11.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Am I "really okay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now they're calling me "Lillian the Devil"!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.79,0:22:14.58,Song,,0,0,0,,What good will asking that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:19.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Just praise me and be on your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.25,0:22:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What're you all laughing about?! This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the one who grew the most\Nover the course of this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:23.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Blame it on a mirror that's unspeakable, unhealable
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what kind of spy was Ms. Hearth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.58,0:22:27.13,Song,,0,0,0,,A sullied life that's unseeable, unfading
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.13,0:22:31.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Tear right on through and see through lies with frigid eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was a blazing fire of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.83,0:22:34.54,Song,,0,0,0,,An innocent item that's unbeatable, unbuyable
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There were times where she could be warm,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and other times when she burned her foes\Nuntil nothing remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.54,0:22:38.04,Song,,0,0,0,,It's an undiscarded corpse, after all
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:43.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Fight back naked with your unconcealed resolve in hand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I try to describe her,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.25,0:22:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I start talking in abstracts without even meaning to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:45.71,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seven years ago, Ms. Hearth made me a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:48.92,Song,,0,0,0,,A wishy-washy destiny all covered in graffiti
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.92,0:22:51.21,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:54.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Recklessly deceiving even God
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She told me that when we met again,\Nshe would give me a lovely present.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.25,0:23:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go on, open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.79,0:23:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A key?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.63,0:23:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"To the girl who will surpass me."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach, just this once...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.21,0:23:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just this once, could you lend me your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made it, Ms. Hearth.
